#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The Hijrah: a journey in stages"
msgstr "Hijrah: safari ya hatua kwa hatua"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "English working draft; no final narration or translation approved"
msgstr "Rasimu ya kazi ya Kiingereza; hakuna masimulizi au tafsiri ya mwisho iliyoidhinishwa"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Connect preparations, the stay at Thawr, the onward journey, and arrival while distinguishing an illustration from its evidence."
msgstr "Unganisha maandalizi, kukaa Thawr, kuendelea kwa safari, na kuwasili huku ukitofautisha mchoro na ushahidi wake."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "How did the journey continue after the cave?"
msgstr "Safari iliendeleaje baada ya pango?"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "Show the onward journey"
msgstr "Onyesha kuendelea kwa safari"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Before the journey"
msgstr "Kabla ya safari"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This chapter follows the Hijrah: the Prophet Muhammad’s ﷺ migration from Makkah to Madinah. We will follow a few connected stages, from preparations for departure to arrival in Madinah."
msgstr "Sura hii inafuata Hijrah: kuhama kwa Mtume Muhammad ﷺ kutoka Makkah kwenda Madinah. Tutafuata hatua chache zilizounganishwa, kuanzia maandalizi ya kuondoka hadi kuwasili Madinah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Before the Prophet departed, some Muslims had already moved to Madinah. Abu Bakr was preparing to leave too, but waited to accompany him. This was part of a wider movement, not a departure in which everyone travelled together."
msgstr "Kabla ya Mtume kuondoka, baadhi ya Waislamu walikuwa tayari wamehamia Madinah. Abu Bakr alikuwa akijiandaa kuondoka pia, lakini alingoja ili kuandamana naye. Hii ilikuwa sehemu ya harakati kubwa zaidi, si kuondoka ambapo kila mtu alisafiri pamoja."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Preparing to leave"
msgstr "Kujiandaa kuondoka"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "When permission to depart had been given, preparations were made for the Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr. ‘Aishah’s account describes provisions packed in a bag. Asma, Abu Bakr’s daughter, used part of her waist-belt to tie its opening."
msgstr "Ruhusa ya kuondoka ilipotolewa, maandalizi yalifanywa kwa ajili ya Mtume ﷺ na Abu Bakr. Masimulizi ya 'Aishah yanaeleza kuhusu vyakula vilivyowekwa kwenye mfuko. Asma, binti yake Abu Bakr, alitumia sehemu ya mshipi wake kufunga mdomo wake."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They also hired a skilled guide, entrusted him with two riding animals, and arranged to meet him at Thawr after three nights. The arrangements for the onward journey were already being made."
msgstr "Pia walikodisha kiongozi stadi wa njia, wakamkabidhi wanyama wawili wa kupanda, na wakapatana kukutana naye huko Thawr baada ya usiku mitatu. Maandalizi ya kuendelea na safari yalikuwa tayari yanafanywa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Three nights at Thawr"
msgstr "Usiku mitatu huko Thawr"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "After the preparations, the Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr sheltered in a cave on Mount Thawr. ‘Aishah’s account in Sahih al-Bukhari records that they stayed there for three nights. This was a stage within the journey, not its destination."
msgstr "Baada ya maandalizi, Mtume ﷺ na Abu Bakr walijificha kwenye pango katika Mlima wa Thawr. Masimulizi ya 'Aishah katika Sahih al-Bukhari yanasajili kwamba walikaa huko kwa usiku mitatu. Hii ilikuwa hatua ndani ya safari, si mwisho wake."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "During the stay, ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr brought news of plans against them. He came after darkness and left before daybreak, returning to Makkah. His contribution was information."
msgstr "Wakati wa kukaa huko, 'Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr alileta habari za mipango dhidi yao. Alikuja baada ya giza kuingia na kuondoka kabla ya mapambazuko, akirejea Makkah. Mchango wake ulikuwa ni taarifa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr’s own account brings us closer to the danger of discovery. He was concerned that they might be seen if someone looked down. The Prophet reassured him."
msgstr "Masimulizi ya Abu Bakr mwenyewe yanatuweka karibu zaidi na hatari ya kugunduliwa. Alikuwa na wasiwasi kwamba huenda wakaonekana ikiwa mtu angetazama chini. Mtume alimtuliza."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The Quran also recalls the two in the cave and the reassurance given to the companion. Ibn Kathir’s commentary on the passage explains the reassurance through Allah’s help and support."
msgstr "Qur'ani pia inawakumbuka wawili hao waliokuwa pangoni na utulivu aliopewa sahaba huyo. Tafsiri ya Ibn Kathir kuhusu kifungu hiki inaeleza utulivu huo kupitia msaada na nusura ya Allah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The journey continues"
msgstr "Safari inaendelea"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The arranged meeting with the guide connects the stay at Thawr to the next stage. When the Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr continued, ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah and the guide went with them. The account says that the guide led them by the coastal way."
msgstr "Mkutano uliopangwa na kiongozi wa njia unaunganisha kukaa Thawr na hatua inayofuata. Mtume ﷺ na Abu Bakr walipoendelea, 'Amir ibn Fuhayrah na kiongozi wa njia walikwenda nao. Masimulizi yanasema kwamba kiongozi huyo aliwaongoza kupitia njia ya pwani."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "That description gives us part of the route’s character, but not every turn or stopping place. The connection shown here is schematic; it is not a measured itinerary."
msgstr "Maelezo hayo yanatupa sehemu ya tabia ya njia hiyo, lakini si kila kona au mahali pa kusimama. Uhusiano unaoonyeshwa hapa ni wa kimchoro tu; si ratiba iliyopimwa kwa usahihi."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Arrival and a new beginning"
msgstr "Kuwasili na mwanzo mpya"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "In Madinah, Muslims went out to wait after hearing that the Prophet ﷺ had left Makkah. The arrival account describes their reception of him and his stay among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."
msgstr "Huko Madinah, Waislamu walitoka kwenda kungoja baada ya kusikia kwamba Mtume ﷺ ameshaondoka Makkah. Masimulizi ya kuwasili yanaeleza mapokezi yake na kukaa kwake miongoni mwa Bani 'Amr ibn 'Awf."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The account goes on to describe a date-drying yard that became the site of the Prophet’s mosque in Madinah. It records the Prophet carrying bricks with those building it."
msgstr "Masimulizi hayo yanaendelea kueleza uwanja wa kukaushia tende ambao ukawa ndio eneo la msikiti wa Mtume huko Madinah. Yanasajili Mtume akibeba matofali pamoja na wale waliokuwa wakiujenga."

