#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Some Muslims moved to Madinah before this departure; the selected passage also describes Abu Bakr waiting to accompany the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "Baadhi ya Waislamu walihamia Madinah kabla ya kuondoka huku; kifungu kilichochaguliwa pia kinaeleza Abu Bakr akingoja ili kuandamana na Mtume ﷺ."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes provisions and Asma bint Abi Bakr using part of her waist-belt to tie the bag."
msgstr "Kifungu kilichochaguliwa kinaeleza kuhusu vyakula na Asma bint Abi Bakr akitumia sehemu ya mshipi wake kufunga mfuko."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage supports the cave on Mount Thawr and three nights."
msgstr "Kifungu kilichochaguliwa kinathibitisha pango kwenye Mlima wa Thawr na usiku mitatu."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish coordinates, dimensions, or the exact arrangement of a visual model."
msgstr "Hakithibitishi viwianishi, vipimo, au mpangilio kamili wa mfano wa kuonekana."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr bringing news of plans against the two companions after darkness."
msgstr "Kifungu kilichochaguliwa kinaeleza jinsi ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr alivyokuwa akileta habari za mipango dhidi ya marafiki wawili hao baada ya giza kuingia."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish modern clock times or a mapped trail."
msgstr "Hakitaji nyakati za saa za kisasa wala njia iliyochorwa kwenye ramani."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage connects ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah with tending sheep and making milk available during the three nights."
msgstr "Kifungu kilichochaguliwa kinamhusisha ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah na uchungaji wa kondoo na upatikanaji wa maziwa katika kipindi cha masiku matatu."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes hiring a skilled guide, entrusting him with two riding animals, and arranging the meeting at Thawr."
msgstr "Kifungu kilichochaguliwa kinaeleza juu ya kukodi kiongozi wa njia mwenye ujuzi, kumkabidhi wanyama wawili wa kupanda, na kupanga mkutano huko Thawr."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage does not supply the guide’s personal name or a precise route."
msgstr "Kifungu kilichochaguliwa hakitaji jina la kibinafsi la kiongozi huyo wa njia wala njia sahihi iliyotumiwa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage says that ‘Amir and the guide went with them and that the guide led them by the coastal way."
msgstr "Kifungu kilichochaguliwa kinasema kwamba ‘Amir na kiongozi wa njia waliondoka nao na kwamba kiongozi huyo aliwaongoza kupitia njia ya pwani."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish every turn, distance, stopping place, or exact GPS route."
msgstr "Hakitaji kila kona, umbali, mahali pa kusimama, au njia sahihi ya GPS."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr’s account records concern about being seen and the Prophet’s reassurance."
msgstr "Simulizi ya Abu Bakr inaeleza wasiwasi wake wa kuonekana na jinsi Mtume alivyomtuliza."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quran"
msgstr "Qur'ani"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected extract recalls the two in the cave and the reassurance to the companion."
msgstr "Sehemu iliyochaguliwa inakumbusha juu ya wawili hao waliokuwa pangoni na utulisho kwa rafiki yake."

