#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Abu Bakr prepared two camels. Asma helped pack food for the journey."
msgstr "Abu Bakr alitayarisha ngamia wawili. Asma alisaidia kufungasha chakula cha safari."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They chose a guide who knew the roads well. He would bring their camels after three nights."
msgstr "Walichagua kiongozi wa njia aliyejua njia vizuri. Angewaletea ngamia wao baada ya masiku matatu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An early account tells how the leaders of Quraysh met in Makkah to plan against the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "Simulizi la mapema linaeleza jinsi viongozi wa Maquraishi walivyokutana Makkah kupanga njama dhidi ya Mtume ﷺ."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "The account says they waited outside his door that night, while ‘Ali slept in his bed, wrapped in his green cloak."
msgstr "Simulizi hilo linasema walingoja nje ya mlango wake usiku huo, huku ‘Ali akilala kitandani mwake, akiwa amejifunika vazi lake la kijani."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "After three nights, their guide brought the camels. They left the cave and travelled towards Madinah."
msgstr "Baada ya masiku matatu, kiongozi wao wa njia alileta ngamia. Waliondoka pangoni na kusafiri kuelekea Madinah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They took a route near the coast. The journey was long, with many stops along the way."
msgstr "Walipita njia iliyo karibu na pwani. Safari ilikuwa ndefu, kukiwa na vituo vingi njiani."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Another account describes a stop at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She had a thin sheep that was not giving milk."
msgstr "Simulizi jingine linaeleza kuhusu kituo kwenye hema la Umm Ma‘bad. Alikuwa na kondoo aliyekonda ambaye hakuwa akitoa maziwa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "It says the Prophet ﷺ prayed and milked the sheep, and there was milk for everyone."
msgstr "Linasema Mtume ﷺ aliomba na kumkama kondoo huyo, na kukawa na maziwa kwa kila mtu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They first stopped at Quba, near Madinah, where a mosque was founded."
msgstr "Kwanza walisimama Quba, karibu na Madinah, ambapo msikiti ulianzishwa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah is to the north. They went south first, towards Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Madinah ipo kaskazini. Walianza kuelekea kusini, kuelekea Mlima Thawr."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "A mosque was founded at Quba, making worship a part of life in the new home."
msgstr "Msikiti ulianzishwa huko Quba, na kuifanya ibada kuwa sehemu ya maisha katika makazi mapya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah became a home for the growing Muslim community, bringing newcomers and their hosts together."
msgstr "Madinah ikawa makazi ya jamii ya Waislamu iliyokuwa ikikua, ikiwaleta pamoja wageni na wenyeji wao."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An eighth-century historian whose accounts of the Prophet’s life are preserved by later writers."
msgstr "Mwanahistoria wa karne ya nane ambaye masimulizi yake kuhusu maisha ya Mtume yamehifadhiwa na waandishi wa baadaye."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Mode changed. Your place is saved."
msgstr "Hali imebadilishwa. Mahali pako pamehifadhiwa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "‘Ali stayed behind to return the precious things that people had left with the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "‘Ali alibaki nyuma ili kurudisha vitu vya thamani ambavyo watu walikuwa wamemwachia Mtume ﷺ."

#: src/lib/scene-manifest.js
msgid "E09"
msgstr "E09"

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "In Madinah, Muslims went out to wait for the Prophet ﷺ. The arrival account tells how they welcomed him."
msgstr "Huko Madinah, Waislamu walitoka kwenda kumsubiri Mtume ﷺ. Simulizi ya kuwasili inaeleza jinsi walivyomkaribisha."

